      "description_html": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"1632bbb3-2dc5-438d-931e-6fe9e0323599\"><strong>목적:</strong> 자격증명·토큰 탐지기 v1.</p><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"7864b522-c34c-47cf-8df8-1745a24b42cf\"><strong>범위:</strong> FR-SEC-01, 부록 B.2 — OpenAI/Anthropic 키(sk-, sk-ant-), GitHub 토큰(ghp_/gho_/github_pat_), AWS Access Key(AKIA+16), Slack/Discord Webhook URL, JWT(eyJ 3분절), Private Key 블록 탐지. 태그 마스킹([SECRET]/[GITHUB_TOKEN]/[AWS_KEY]/[WEBHOOK]/[JWT]/[PRIVATE_KEY]).</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-7 space-y-(--list-spacing-y) tight\" data-id=\"b6dab41b-49f5-48a1-8e62-4d6360418f8b\" data-tight=\"true\"><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"66a7445a-19da-40b9-b0c5-ac504da621ab\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"b44033f3-bcec-4b33-bc3d-e0292b026d27\">T-01 데모의 .env 내 토큰이 탐지·차단 근거로 기록</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"3a965731-3345-488b-9c00-80f4b5f6c91d\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"54bef341-d42b-4084-9434-d2e2fec369a2\">국내 토큰(GMCP-71)·고엔트로피(GMCP-72) 확장의 기반 구조</p></li></ul>",
